      "title": "/integration-audit — invalidate + re-audit the sidecar pipeline",
      "description": "Sidecar-invalidation utility for the integration-watcher pipeline. Adds mechanical QA fields (script-reviewer entries) to per-block `.qa.json` sidecars and marks the existing entries stale so the next `qa-sweep` re-evaluates them. Use when a checker bug is fixed in `qa-checkers-voice.ts` (downstream \"fresh\" entries are now incorrect) or when a registry update adds a criterion the block hasn't been audited under.",
